  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Kaizen expansion project (Phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the policies of the Ghana Government&apos;s &quot;24 Hour+ Programme&quot; and the achievements of the past years through the &quot;U-SPARK Project&quot;, UNIDO and the Ministry of Trade, Agribusiness and Industry (MoTAI) jointly formulated the concept of the &quot;U-SPARK Project Phase 2&quot;. In this phase, the project will further promote the digitalization of the Ghanaian manufacturing industry through the expansion of U-SPARK, as well as to develop human resources for young people and women.</narrative>
  </description>
